 ### HTTP Endpoints
 
-| Method | Path | Response |
+| Method | Path | Description |
 | --- | --- | --- |
-| GET | `/tasks` | 200: `[Task,...]` |
-| POST | `/tasks` | 201: `Task` or 400: `{"error": ...}` |
-| GET | `/tasks/<id>` | 200: `Task` or 404 |
-| PATCH | `/tasks/<id>` | 200: `Task` or 400 or 404 |
